message: >-
  If you use RIFT Input Builder in research, please cite this software and the
  original data products selected by your case provenance report.
title: RIFT Input Builder
type: software
version: 0.3.0
date-released: 2026-10-07
authors:
  - name: RIFT Input Builder contributors
license: BSD-3-Clause
abstract: >-
  A raw-first, provenance-preserving notebook and Python package for preparing
  simulation-ready terrain, land-cover, soil, rainfall, and boundary inputs for RIFT.
keywords:
  - RIFT
  - hydrology
  - flood modeling
  - geospatial preprocessing
